comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-16T10:51:21.338Z","harness:claude-code","Reproduction, exact commands and observed bytes on this tracker at tree 9da5886cc:\n\n  pm context --limit 10                              7,988 B  ~1,997 tok  result returned\n  pm context --for orient                            7,832 B  ~1,958 tok  result returned, budget 2400\n  pm context --for orient --limit 10                   520 B              RESULT OMITTED\n  pm context --for orient --limit 50                   520 B              RESULT OMITTED\n  pm context --for orient --token-budget 20000         521 B              RESULT OMITTED\n  pm context --for orient --token-budget 200000    448,564 B  ~112k tok   result returned, receipt says estimated_tokens 132522\n  pm context --for handoff                           4,588 B              result returned\n  pm context --for handoff --limit 10                  524 B              RESULT OMITTED\n\nThe receipt for the omitted case, verbatim: token_budget 2400, estimated_tokens 122, within_budget false, declaration_feasible false, result_omitted true, degradation budget_receipt_only.\n\nThree separable defects in one path: (1) the reported estimate is recomputed over the refusal so it contradicts the verdict it accompanies; (2) --limit turns a feasible intent infeasible on both declared context intents; (3) an explicit --token-budget replaces the declared ceiling instead of being bounded by it, so the same intent that declares 2400 emits 132522 with no field saying the declaration was overridden.\n\nThis is the fifth defect landed against the declared-intent layer after pm-ai45y9, pm-7hbfch, pm-prsvjh and pm-yekkvt. pm-yekkvt's AC4 already forbids recovery guidance that points at the unprojected command when that form is larger; here the unprojected form is SMALLER and succeeds, so the guidance is wrong in the direction that AC did not anticipate."
  "2026-08-16T12:30:33.607Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: the default orient contract now clamps an explicit --limit 10 to its measured three-row budget ceiling, returns useful hierarchy/blocker/activity context at 2,587 estimated tokens under the 3,000 declaration, retains the pre-omission infeasibility estimate, emits an executable bounded retry, and discloses a 197,000-token override when the caller requests 200,000. The reviewed calibration report remains far below the new ceiling at both 2 and 2,243 items."
  "2026-08-16T13:26:21.804Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: exact 100/100/100/100 coverage and the full 7,411-test suite passed. Static calibration, token-budget, and packed npx/bunx acceptance passed. In a new isolated tracker, context --for orient returned useful rows with declared_token_budget=3000, override=0, budget_derived_limit=3, binding_constraint=token_budget, estimated_tokens=649, within_budget=true, and an executable bounded recovery contract for infeasible results is covered."
  "2026-08-16T13:42:30.195Z","harness:codex","Reviewed-product lineage: implementation is published in https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1042 at initial head f4ff1a393 and the PR body links this item on the GitHub-renderable main path."
  "2026-08-16T15:03:22.597Z","harness:codex","Review-fix evidence: declaration_feasible is now measured against declared_token_budget before an effective override is applied. Tests cover both a feasible declaration omitted by a lower effective override and an infeasible declaration delivered by a higher override. The real token-budget negative control now verifies effective-budget infeasibility truthfully. Repo-wide pnpm lint and the token/context assurance gates passed; full coverage passed 507 files / 7,414 tests at 100/100/100/100."
  "2026-08-16T15:58:55.505Z","harness:codex","Exact-head review resolution: recovery receipts now retain and shell-quote the original get item id or search query, including apostrophes; within_budget is documented as effective-ceiling evidence; and the token negative control now requires token_budget=256 with a finite estimate strictly above it. The real gate passed 32 surfaces, manual temp-tracker execution ran the emitted apostrophe-bearing retry verbatim and returned one useful result within budget, all linked tests passed, and full coverage passed 507 files / 7,415 tests at exact 100/100/100/100."
